Wanted lists ordered by viewing priority (feature_subtitle_coverage_priority_20261108, Phase 2).

- GET /api/subtitles/wanted/series and /wanted/movies return `priority: { bucket, rank }` and are sorted continue-watching -> recently-watched -> recently-added -> backfill.
- Batch progress loading via ViewingPriorityQuery (one query per media type), pure added-date fallback when prisma has no drizzle handle.
- Episodes use their series' added date; movies use their own.

Live verification after deploy: /api/subtitles/wanted/series page 1 = The 100 S1E3, The Sopranos S1E1 (continue-watching), then The Walking Dead (backfill).
